@startuml
title Online Quiz System State Diagram

[*] --> Login

state Login <<choice>>
Login : entry / To register or login
Login : do / enter credentials
Login : exit / Entered into system

state "User Type" as UserType {
    [Login] --> Teacher
    [Login] --> Student
}

state "Teacher Dashboard" as TeacherDashboard
TeacherDashboard : entry / After login
TeacherDashboard : do / create, edit or manage quizzes
TeacherDashboard : exit / NIL

state CreateQuiz <<choice>>
TeacherDashboard --> CreateQuiz
CreateQuiz : [create a new quiz]
CreateQuiz : [save as draft or post for students]

state EditQuiz <<choice>>
TeacherDashboard --> EditQuiz
EditQuiz : [edit an existing quiz]
EditQuiz : [save as draft or post for students]

state "View Quiz Results" as ViewResults
ViewResults : entry / After quiz is over
ViewResults : do / view results
ViewResults : exit / NIL

state StudentDashboard <<choice>>
TeacherDashboard --> StudentDashboard
StudentDashboard : [get notified and select a quiz]
StudentDashboard : [answer the selected quiz]
StudentDashboard : [submit the quiz]
StudentDashboard : [view result after submitting the quiz]

@enduml
